,"a":93,"sd":null},{"k":"15:94","t":"Then declare what you are commanded and turn away from the polytheists.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":94,"sd":null},{"k":"15:95","t":"Indeed, We are sufficient for you against the mockers","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":95,"sd":null},{"k":"15:96","t":"Who make [equal] with Allāh another deity. But they are going to know.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":96,"sd":null},{"k":"15:97","t":"And We already know that your breast is constrained by what they say.","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":97,"sd":null},{"k":"15:98","t":"So exalt [Allāh] with praise of your Lord and be of those who prostrate [to Him].","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":98,"sd":null},{"k":"15:99","t":"And worship your Lord until there comes to you the certainty [i.e., death].","j":14,"h":27,"s":15,"a":99,"sd":null},{"k":"16:1","t":"The command of Allāh is coming, so be not impatient for it. Exalted is He and high above what they associate with Him.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":1,"sd":null},{"k":"16:2","t":"He sends down the angels, with the inspiration [i.e., revelation] of His command, upon whom He wills of His servants, [telling them], \"Warn that there is no deity except Me; so fear Me.\"","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":2,"sd":null},{"k":"16:3","t":"He created the heavens and earth in truth. High is He above what they associate with Him.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":3,"sd":null},{"k":"16:4","t":"He created man from a sperm-drop; then at once he is a clear adversary.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":4,"sd":null},{"k":"16:5","t":"And the grazing livestock He has created for you; in them is warmth and [numerous] benefits, and from them you eat.","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":5,"sd":null},{"k":"16:6","t":"And for you in them is [the enjoyment of] beauty when you bring them in [for the evening] and when you send them out [to pasture].","j":14,"h":27,"s":16,"a":6,"sd":null}],"juz":14,"hizb":27,"surahs":[15,16],"sajdah":false}